── CLOSURE THAT CAN'T RUN IN PARALLEL ── E0431_record_that_holds_a_shared_value.lt:7:15  [E0431]

This closure can't run in parallel: it reaches `scale`, whose field `factor`
holds a `Shared<T>`:

  6 │ fn scaled(scale: Scale, xs: List<i64>) -> List<i64> {
    │           ───── `scale` holds a `Shared<T>` from here
  7 │   par.map(xs, |x| x * scale.name.len())
    │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

`std.par` runs the closure on other threads, so it can't reach a `Shared` value.
Read the shared value once before the call, and capture the copy.
